656 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (What truly draws me to this opportunity is Tover's commitment to creating meaningful experiences for individuals living with cognitive challenges and their caregivers. My interest in design has always been driven by the desire to make a positive impact on people's lives. Your innovative Tovertafel seems like a magic wand that brings joy and inclusion to a demographic that often gets overlooked, and I'd be honored to contribute to this noble purpose.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
