<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (At Fontys, I have actively participated in various school projects and have had the opportunity to work on creating solutions for real-world settings. Through these projects, I've gained hands-on experience in user research, which I understand is a key part of this role. I've developed competencies in prototype creation and visualizing, helping me translate user needs and wishes into effective, stimulating design concepts.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
