<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As an ICT student at Fontys University, I am passionate about user experience and committed to fostering consumer-centric innovations. I am excited to apply for the Sensory & Consumer Research Internship at Danone's global User eXperience team, where I believe my knowledge and experience can bring a fresh perspective to your initiatives.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
680 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (My academic journey, focused on both software development and UI/UX design, has been underscored by an inherent interest in the intersections of technology, design, and human behavior. This interest aligns perfectly with the User eXperience team's mission of delivering the best possible product experience to patients and healthcare professionals. I'm particularly fascinated by your work in specialized nutrition, and I see a tremendous opportunity to apply my skills in this area.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
681 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Throughout my studies, I have actively used sensory and consumer science methodologies in various projects, with a focus on gathering and analyzing data to yield actionable insights. I have honed my skills in organizing and leading teams, which I believe will enable me to co-lead UX research programs and support innovation effectively. Moreover, my proficiency in tools such as Figma will be beneficial in translating insights into prototype development.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
682 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (At Fontys, I've learned the importance of embracing a user-centric mindset and have seen first-hand how this approach can enhance product usability and satisfaction. I am confident that I can bring this perspective to the Danone team, supporting flavour development, prototype screening, and driving user-centricity across various projects.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5]
>>
